note right of SwipeService
  recordSwipe() is annotated @Transactional.
  It validates users, locks the pair, stores the
  current swipe and history, then checks for a
  reciprocal LIKE and creates/reactivates a match.
end note

note bottom of SwipeRequest
  viewerId and targetUserId:
  @NotNull + @Positive

  decision:
  @NotNull
end note

